	(text "Batteries: two 2S 18650 strings + 5 A discharge fuses.\nCharge Path A/B: per-string ideal-diode charge input (LTC4412 + Si7625DN + 1.5 A fuse).\nDual Ideal Diode: LTC4353 ORs both strings onto VBAT_RAW.\nHeater A/B: autonomous thermostat + FPF2700 driving each string's Kapton heater.\nJ_EXT1 to the PDU: 1 CHG_IN_A, 2 VBAT_RAW, 3 +3V3, 4 GND, 5 CHG_IN_B (tie 1 and 5 on the PDU side)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 116.84 142.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0ef7e6f3-836b-44e5-8da7-2cc0244c762c")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAGs mark where each rail is sourced (battery strings, PDU connector) so ERC can check power pins."
